raw:
GOAL: I believe this is a navigation/collection puzzle: move the small blue+yellow player around the light-blue open regions to reach/collect the green notched blocks (the only other colored objects), possibly requiring the player to carry or place the yellow item; the dotted black areas are walls.
CONTROLS: LEFT/RIGHT move the player horizontally (no UP/DOWN available, so vertical motion must come from gravity, slopes, or another mechanism); MOUSE clicks a board cell, likely to select, jump, place, or teleport/interact; UNDO reverses the last move; RESET restarts the level.
RULE: I will treat green blocks as the targets and the blue/yellow sprite as my avatar, and play by probing each control once in isolation and reading the frame diff (movement vs. HUD only) before committing to a plan;
